        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Part I Line 2</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>We recorded 118,800 in non-cash contributions for 2024. In addition to the 1,800 reported for donated wine in Part I, we also reported 52,000 for venue usage during the year planning meetings and various events, 40,000 for ENVZN 24 programming by cultural partner organizations, 11,000 for professional curators, 5,000 was for professional event managment, 3,000 for graffitti removal, 2,000 for PR professionals and marketing, 2,000 for professional photography videography, 1,000 for professional safety management, 1,000 for professional lighting and sound.</ExplanationTxt>
